+
+It exited 0. I then ran fresh `krun` executions for:
+
+```text
+(-7,101,-303), (0,101,-303), (1,101,-303),
+(2,101,-303), (3,101,-303), (4,101,-303),
+(7,34,12), (15,8,5), (49,0,17),
+(97,11,22), (121,11,22)
